PROVEX patch 01-config-env
Read the DB connection (PGHOST/PGPORT/PGUSER/PGPASSWORD/PGDATABASE), KAIROS_ARTIFACT_DIR, KAIROS_RAW_DIR and KAIROS_GRAPHS_DIR from the environment; the upstream values are the defaults.
Series: upstream ProvenanceAnalytics/kairos@0e0b633beb46a1117c0a6d63be5d2481b59ac0dc DARPA/CADETS_E3, patches 01..11 applied in numeric order.
Paths are relative to DARPA/CADETS_E3: apply to a copy of kairos/upstream/ that is outside any git work tree (git apply <patch>), or from the repository root with git apply --directory=<copy dir> <patch>.

diff --git a/config.py b/config.py
index 7d53cf1..a3e3d25 100644
--- a/config.py
+++ b/config.py
@@ -1,17 +1,33 @@
+import os
+
+
+def _env(name, default):
+    """Value of environment variable `name`, or `default` when unset/empty."""
+    value = os.environ.get(name)
+    if value is None or value == "":
+        return default
+    return value
+
+
+def _env_dir(name, default):
+    """Like _env, but always ends with "/" (paths are built by concatenation)."""
+    return os.path.join(_env(name, default), "")
+
+
